Changelog: 20-11-2026 14:51:00

Added. Quickfix has a group Prime95 with mprime: its pill installs it through Board Test's installer (--mprime),
and Install all does too. No test uses it: BC-250 CPU Tools runs its torture test for a longer burn-in. It needs
the Board Test release that has --mprime. vulkan-tools names test 60 (VKCube) too.

