Changelog: 17-11-2026 23:56:01

Release 0.1.0.

Changelog: 17-11-2026 22:52:43

Added. BC-250 Quickfix: the first version. Small windows for one job each, which come with the suite and are each a
tile of their own on Utilities: Quickfix (the optional tools Board Test's tests use, with their installer),
MangoHud Config and the windows that change a setting of the system and undo it again. Every file the app writes
carries its own name (bc250-quickfix). It takes the place of the app that held these windows before, and knows
nothing of that app's files: what was turned on there is turned off there, or by hand.
